  m_text: 'The supreme authorities of Heaven and Hell decided to end the conflict
    between them and jointly established this unbreakable "Covenant" to define the
    rules governing the mortal realm.


    Article 1: From the moment this Covenant
    takes effect, no angel from Heaven or demon from Hell may directly descend in
    the mortal realm.'
